@startuml
!theme plain
hide footbox
title 两种模式的物理执行流程对比

== 中心化动态规划 ==
participant "TaskGraphService" as CG
box "Master Bot runtime" #D6EAF8
participant "中心化\nTaskPlanner" as CP
participant "中心化\nTaskDispatcher" as CD
end box
box "被选执行 runtime" #FCF3CF
participant "TaskRunner" as CR
end box
participant "实际 executor" as CX

CG -> CP : PLAN_REQUESTED(TaskContext)
CP -> CG : report(PLAN, PlanResult)
CG -> CD : DISPATCH_REQUESTED(TaskNode)
CD -> CG : report(DISPATCH, TaskNodePatch)
CG -> CR : EXECUTION_REQUESTED(TaskNode)
CR -> CX : 启动节点执行
CX -> CG : report(EXECUTION_RESULT)
note right of CG
下一轮 PLAN_REQUESTED
仍定向投递给 Master runtime
end note

newpage

== 分布式接力规划 ==
participant "TaskGraphService" as RG
box "Bot A runtime（物理同驻）" #D5F5E3
participant "A 的\nTaskRunner" as AR
participant "A 的 relay\nTaskPlanner" as AP
participant "A 的 relay\nTaskDispatcher" as AD
end box
box "Bot B / 协作群 / BBS\n实际执行 runtime" #FCF3CF
participant "B 的\nTaskRunner" as BR
end box
participant "B 的 executor" as BX

AR -> RG : report(EXECUTION_RESULT of A)
RG -> RG : 原子接纳 A 的结果\n重建最新完整 TaskContext
RG -> AP : PLAN_REQUESTED(TaskContext)
AP -> RG : report(PLAN, PlanResult for B)
RG -> AD : DISPATCH_REQUESTED(TaskNode B)
AD -> RG : report(DISPATCH, TaskNodePatch for B)
RG -> BR : EXECUTION_REQUESTED(TaskNode B)
BR -> BX : 启动 B 的执行
BX -> RG : report(EXECUTION_RESULT of B)
note right of RG
下一轮可定向投递给 B runtime，
重复相同事件链
end note

note over AR,BR
接力模式中 A runtime 虽物理托管 Runner、Planner、Dispatcher，
但它们仍只经 Graph 事件衔接；不存在 Runner 直接调用 Planner/Dispatcher 的内存旁路。
end note
@enduml
